格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Cross-session messaging between live DSH sessions in one process: one session sends a text message to another and triggers its event processing, or appends a custom event to its durable log.","id":"gh:1340584909","install_available":false,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-cross-session","slug":"vongostev/dsh-cross-session","topics":["dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Cross-session messaging between live DSH sessions in one process: one session sends a text message t"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"o another and triggers its event processing, or appends a custom event to its durable log."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# @vongostev/dsh-cross-session"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English | 中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"Cross-session messaging between live DSH sessions in one process: one session sends a text message t"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"o another and triggers its event processing, or appends a custom event to its durable log."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## What it does"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"The plugin registers three model-facing tools on `ctx.tools`:"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"- `cross_session_list` — live sessions with `id`, `status`, and (when the title seam is composed) `t"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"itle`.\n- `cross_session_send` — delivers a text message into the target's inbox and wakes its agent "},{"id":"p7s3","text":"loop. Modes: `followup` (default) starts or continues a turn; `steer` delivers at the next step boun"},{"id":"p7s4","text":"dary and also wakes the target; `inject` only queues the message without waking.\n- `cross_session_em"},{"id":"p7s5","text":"it` — appends a `cross-session/event` to the target's durable log. Every `session/event` listener on"},{"id":"p7s6","text":" that session fires synchronously; no model turn starts."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Delivery semantics"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"`cross_session_send` reuses the agent inbox seam (`Agent.followup` / `steer` / `inject` from `@deeps"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"eek-ai/dsh-agent`): the target session durably logs `agent/inbox/spliced`, fires live `agent/inbox/i"},{"id":"p9s3","text":"nserted` and `session/event` dispatch, and — for `followup` and `steer` — the target loop wakes and "},{"id":"p9s4","text":"processes the message as a turn. Delivered messages carry `source: { kind: 'plugin', plugin: 'cross-"},{"id":"p9s5","text":"session', form: 'relay' }` and a `[cross-session message from <sender>]` text prefix, so the target "},{"id":"p9s6","text":"transcript records who sent the message. The sender is the owning agent of the tool call, or `'unkno"},{"id":"p9s7","text":"wn'` outside an agent boundary."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"A tool call resolves its target through `ctx.agents.get(id)`; a session that is not live in the proc"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"ess (not loaded, or in another process) is rejected with `ok: false` plus the live session ids."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## Export shape"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"The package exports a function plugin (`name` / `inject` / `apply`, no default export) and, under `."},{"id":"p12s2","text":"/invariant`, the durable `cross-session/event` invariant companion: it rejects any `cross-session/ev"},{"id":"p12s3","text":"ent` record whose `from` or `kind` is missing or empty, failing loud at the append boundary instead "},{"id":"p12s4","text":"of letting a malformed record poison the durable log. The `cross-session/event` event type is declar"},{"id":"p12s5","text":"ed in `src/types.ts` through `SessionEventMap` declaration merging."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"## Consumption"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"Install the package in a DSH deployment, then add a row to its `cordis.yml`:"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"The row composes the three `cross_session_*` tools. The plugin requires the standard harness seams `"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"ctx.tools` and `ctx.agents` (already composed by every DSH deployment) and their `@deepseek-ai/*` pe"},{"id":"p17s3","text":"ctx.agents` (already composed by every DSH deployment) and their `@deepseek-ai/*` peer dependencies."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"The `cross-session/event` invariant companion is a separate module and mounts only when the deployme"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"nt also composes the invariant registry:"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"From a source checkout, build and test the package standalone:"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"## Dependency status"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"Checked against the npm registry at the time of writing, every `@deepseek-ai/*` dependency is publis"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"hed, and `npm install` in this repository resolves the whole dependency graph from the public regist"},{"id":"p23s3","text":", and `npm install` in this repository resolves the whole dependency graph from the public registry:"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"| Package | Range |"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"| `@deepseek-ai/cordis` | `^4.0.1` |\n| `@deepseek-ai/cordis-plugin-loader` | `^1.0.2` |\n| `@deepseek"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"-ai/cordis-plugin-include` | `^1.0.6` |\n| `@deepseek-ai/dsh-agent` | `^0.1.0-rc.8` |\n| `@deepseek-ai"},{"id":"p25s3","text":"/dsh-invariants` | `^0.1.0-rc.8` |\n| `@deepseek-ai/dsh-llm` | `^0.1.0-rc.8` |\n| `@deepseek-ai/dsh-se"},{"id":"p25s4","text":"ssion` | `^0.1.0-rc.8` |\n| `@deepseek-ai/dsh-session-title` | `^0.1.0-rc.8` |\n| `@deepseek-ai/dsh-sy"},{"id":"p25s5","text":"stem-prompt` | `^0.1.0-rc.8` |\n| `@deepseek-ai/dsh-tools` | `^0.1.0-rc.8` |"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"This package is published under npm's `next` dist-tag as `0.1.0-rc.8` (`latest` currently points at "},{"id":"p26s2","text":"the same build); install it with `@next` while the `0.1.0-rc.x` line is current. The `@deepseek-ai/*"},{"id":"p26s3","text":"` peer dependencies are published on the same `0.1.0-rc.x` line, but their `latest` tags lag for sev"},{"id":"p26s4","text":"eral packages, so align the peer ranges above rather than rely on the default `latest` tag."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"## Model Experience"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"### Tool schemas"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"#### What the model sees"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"The model sees the generated cross-session tool schemas; their descriptions are pinned verbatim in `"},{"id":"p30s2","text":" the generated cross-session tool schemas; their descriptions are pinned verbatim in `src/index.ts`:"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"##### `cross_session_list` description"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"##### `cross_session_send` description"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"##### `cross_session_emit` description"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"#### Token effect"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"Fixed, conditional: the three tool descriptions ride the system prompt whenever the tools registry i"},{"id":"p38s2","text":"s composed. Each call contributes its arguments and its JSON result to the calling session's log; de"},{"id":"p38s3","text":"livered text also enters the target session's log as a `user/message` when the target loop processes"},{"id":"p38s4","text":" a `followup`/`steer` delivery."},{"id":"p39s1","text":"## Known Limitations and Deferred Work"},{"id":"p40s1","text":"- **Durable-event readability coupling** — `cross-session/event` is a custom event type known only t"},{"id":"p40s2","text":"o harness builds that include this package's upstream. A build whose `KNOWN_SESSION_EVENT_TYPES` lac"},{"id":"p40s3","text":"ks the type refuses logs carrying it unless the event is marked `ignorable`; this package does not s"},{"id":"p40s4","text":"et that marker (matching upstream), so the event remains readable by current harness builds.\n- **Liv"},{"id":"p40s5","text":"e sessions only** — delivery and emit require a live agent in the current process (`ctx.agents.get`)"},{"id":"p40s6","text":". A persisted session that is not loaded is unreachable and must be resumed before it can receive me"},{"id":"p40s7","text":"ssages; sessions in other processes or deployments are never reachable.\n- **No processing receipt** "},{"id":"p40s8","text":"— `cross_session_send` confirms insertion into the target inbox, not that the target model actually "},{"id":"p40s9","text":"processed the message. `inject` mode queues without waking by design."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
